WEBVTT

01:36.590 --> 01:40.030
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.110 --> 01:41.900
[Episode 35]

01:57.759 --> 01:59.479
Weren't you doing well

01:59.509 --> 02:01.070
at Bee?

02:01.210 --> 02:02.650
Why did you suddenly quit?

02:05.130 --> 02:06.860
As a programmer,

02:07.290 --> 02:08.840
where I work doesn't matter.

02:09.889 --> 02:10.990
It matters.

02:11.400 --> 02:12.860
For your profession,

02:12.890 --> 02:15.290
Beijing, Hangzhou, or Shenzhen

02:15.310 --> 02:16.260
can offer better prospects.

02:18.370 --> 02:19.930
Prospects?

02:21.360 --> 02:22.710
Are they important?

02:24.120 --> 02:24.910
Of course they are.

02:33.110 --> 02:34.490
Then why did you come back?

02:42.100 --> 02:43.579
We're different.

02:44.329 --> 02:45.450
How?

02:47.160 --> 02:48.730
You're a boy.

02:49.190 --> 02:51.970
To start a family, you must first establish a career.

02:52.170 --> 02:53.540
I'm a girl.

02:53.570 --> 02:55.290
I can start a family without a career.

03:05.370 --> 03:06.640
Who do you want to start a family with?

03:06.680 --> 03:08.200
None of your business.

03:08.470 --> 03:11.490
Given how pretty, charming, and kind I am,

03:11.720 --> 03:13.620
it's easy for me to get married.

03:15.560 --> 03:17.270
Wanghe is the first in line.

03:17.520 --> 03:19.890
He'll go mad if someone cuts in line.

03:31.630 --> 03:33.910
It's about to rain. Let's go home.

03:33.940 --> 03:34.710
Okay.

03:38.500 --> 03:40.280
Shouldn't you have dinner with me to welcome me back?

03:41.120 --> 03:43.520
Alright, have your dad cook tonight.

03:43.540 --> 03:44.310
I'll order the dishes.

03:44.340 --> 03:45.250
No problem.

03:57.230 --> 03:58.220
Here.

03:58.770 --> 03:59.890
Thank you, Auntie.

04:02.640 --> 04:03.710
How are things lately?

04:04.240 --> 04:05.360
Have you found a job?

04:06.960 --> 04:08.110
No, I...

04:08.150 --> 04:09.500
I don't know what I want to do.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.690
You can't just sit around idle all day.

04:10.740 --> 04:12.820
You need to work, don't you?

04:12.960 --> 04:13.680
Yes.

04:13.680 --> 04:14.360
Am I right?

04:14.400 --> 04:16.529
Mom, stop nagging.

04:16.550 --> 04:17.950
Xingchi isn't a child.

04:17.950 --> 04:19.390
He doesn't need you to worry about him.

04:19.850 --> 04:21.070
I don't worry,

04:21.070 --> 04:22.680
but his parents do.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.160
Enough.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.360
There are a few dirty dishes in the kitchen.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.380
Help me wash them.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.000
Thank you, Mom.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.450
I'll leave you to talk.

04:28.560 --> 04:29.040
Okay.

04:31.870 --> 04:33.500
Don't listen to my mom.

04:33.750 --> 04:34.920
When it comes to finding a job,

04:34.920 --> 04:36.310
you should listen to yourself.

04:37.750 --> 04:38.700
What do you think

04:40.270 --> 04:41.390
I'm suited for?

04:42.320 --> 04:43.900
Rather than what you're suited for,

04:44.390 --> 04:45.310
it's more about

04:45.310 --> 04:46.159
what you like.

04:48.050 --> 04:48.970
When we were young,

04:49.070 --> 04:50.310
we looked for jobs

04:50.390 --> 04:52.480
that had high salaries

04:52.600 --> 04:53.560
and low barriers to entry.

04:54.150 --> 04:56.040
We always felt that as long as we worked hard enough,

04:56.190 --> 04:58.040
we could carve out a path for ourselves.

04:59.530 --> 05:01.520
But think about all these past years.

05:01.540 --> 05:03.310
How many jobs have we tried?

05:03.480 --> 05:04.310
What did we get?

05:05.350 --> 05:07.020
I think at this age,

05:07.560 --> 05:08.600
we should think about

05:09.370 --> 05:11.170
what we really like to do.

05:11.640 --> 05:13.740
Otherwise, you'd still be wasting your life.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.320
You'd regret it when you're older.

05:22.520 --> 05:24.250
Eat up. What are you thinking about?

05:26.200 --> 05:27.460
I'm just…

05:31.060 --> 05:33.800
thinking about how to know what I like.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.360
You need to think about that?

05:36.870 --> 05:37.920
Don't you know

05:37.950 --> 05:39.240
what you like and dislike?

05:39.570 --> 05:40.890
It's just like dating.

05:41.360 --> 05:42.430
Isn't who you are into

05:42.870 --> 05:44.430
crystal clear in your heart?

05:44.600 --> 05:45.400
Also,

05:46.900 --> 05:49.270
when you truly enjoy doing something,

05:49.560 --> 05:50.920
you'll feel that

05:50.920 --> 05:52.240
time passes incredibly fast.

05:52.390 --> 05:53.040
An entire afternoon

05:53.210 --> 05:54.720
will be gone in the blink of an eye.

05:54.940 --> 05:55.740
Right?

06:10.070 --> 06:12.630
Cheers. Congratulations!

06:23.070 --> 06:24.800
Speed it up a bit!

06:24.800 --> 06:25.630
Uncle Zhou.

06:35.100 --> 06:35.870
Come on.

06:40.659 --> 06:42.100
Go ahead. What's the matter?

06:43.620 --> 06:44.620
I want to

06:45.010 --> 06:46.200
become your apprentice.

06:48.790 --> 06:49.350
You...

06:49.810 --> 06:51.770
I've loved cooking since I was a child.

06:52.580 --> 06:54.360
I-I feel

06:54.390 --> 06:55.800
at ease

06:55.890 --> 06:57.090
when I cook.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.430
At ease?

06:59.820 --> 07:01.120
I love

07:01.160 --> 07:02.920
the sizzling sounds in the wok.

07:03.090 --> 07:05.220
I also love the smell of cooking oil.

07:06.870 --> 07:08.600
I just feel that

07:09.160 --> 07:10.040
when I'm cooking,

07:10.040 --> 07:12.240
time passes incredibly fast.

07:13.450 --> 07:14.520
And then?

07:15.600 --> 07:16.780
Then you feel

07:16.810 --> 07:18.180
all your worries

07:18.270 --> 07:19.120
disappear,

07:19.370 --> 07:20.290
and you're able to

07:20.320 --> 07:22.110
control everything on the stove?

07:22.140 --> 07:23.920
Yes, that's exactly the feeling.

07:23.940 --> 07:24.960
That's the feeling.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.740
But Xingchi,

07:28.870 --> 07:30.060
it's a bit late.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.510
You know what?

07:31.560 --> 07:33.560
Cooks need to start young.

07:34.460 --> 07:35.750
I-It doesn't matter.

07:35.750 --> 07:38.210
I-I don't aim to be a top chef.

07:38.450 --> 07:39.830
As long as I can learn something,

07:40.440 --> 07:42.320
I don't mind being a kitchen helper.

07:43.950 --> 07:44.630
Alright.

07:45.450 --> 07:46.230
Then,

07:46.250 --> 07:47.530
you'll start as a kitchen hand.

07:48.159 --> 07:48.970
Thank you, Master.

07:49.070 --> 07:50.120
Hold on.

07:50.420 --> 07:52.380
Have I taken you as my apprentice?

07:53.310 --> 07:54.570
Listen.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.600
Being a kitchen hand means

07:56.600 --> 07:58.600
you won't get to cook for months.

07:58.950 --> 07:59.510
Are you okay with that?

07:59.600 --> 08:00.390
Yes.

08:00.730 --> 08:01.920
As long as I can learn something,

08:01.920 --> 08:02.950
I'm willing to do anything.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.190
Alright then.

08:07.040 --> 08:08.390
When the time comes,

08:08.390 --> 08:10.390
you'll make a bowl of Yang Chun Noodles as the test.

08:10.710 --> 08:11.710
If you pass it,

08:12.160 --> 08:13.040
I'll take you as my apprentice.

08:13.060 --> 08:13.720
No problem.

08:13.720 --> 08:15.040
Don't be so confident.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.830
You think it's easy to make Yang Chun Noodles?

08:17.740 --> 08:19.820
The simpler a dish is, the harder it is to make it great.

08:20.030 --> 08:20.800
Understand?

08:24.300 --> 08:26.140
Then, Uncle Zhou, what should I

08:26.170 --> 08:27.260
do now?

08:27.620 --> 08:28.630
Now?

08:29.160 --> 08:30.050
Cut your hair.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.600
Otherwise, the deal is off the table.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.750
I-I'll go cut it right now.

08:35.770 --> 08:37.840
I'm on it. I'm on it.

08:41.039 --> 08:41.919
Brat.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.120
Dad.

08:48.170 --> 08:50.120
Rui, take a look at this.

08:51.410 --> 08:52.610
Careful.

08:52.750 --> 08:53.840
Look.

08:56.000 --> 08:57.080
Zhou Yiyan?

08:57.550 --> 08:58.600
Yes!

08:59.000 --> 08:59.910
This watch

09:00.000 --> 09:01.820
is a family heirloom of Mr. Zhou's.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.470
Its movement was broken.

09:03.500 --> 09:06.120
Last year, Mr. Zhou brought this watch here for repair,

09:06.200 --> 09:07.340
but he forgot about it.

09:07.550 --> 09:09.240
Zhou mentioned it briefly,

09:09.240 --> 09:10.750
and we managed to retrieve it.

09:11.260 --> 09:13.260
The engraving on it is in Italian.

09:13.280 --> 09:16.100
And I've seen this pattern online before.

09:16.320 --> 09:18.600
The key is the name Zhou Yiyan.

09:18.620 --> 09:20.410
It was mentioned in Little Polo's diary.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.520
He was the second apprentice of the seafarer Xia.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.990
We found a match for the Zhou family too.

09:26.080 --> 09:28.480
Let's go tell Uncle Zhou then.

09:28.500 --> 09:29.180
Let's go.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.390
Let's go.

09:32.370 --> 09:33.660
Here. Look.

09:34.170 --> 09:35.130
Here.

09:35.800 --> 09:38.640
[Zhou Yiyan]

09:37.030 --> 09:37.960
Yeah.

09:39.200 --> 09:39.960
Well…

09:41.220 --> 09:42.250
Well…

09:43.620 --> 09:44.630
if that's the case,

09:44.630 --> 09:46.440
my ancestor was also on this ship?

09:47.360 --> 09:48.360
Yes.

09:48.990 --> 09:50.960
Otherwise, why would your dad have paid

09:50.960 --> 09:51.910
so much attention to this matter?

09:52.260 --> 09:54.850
He's never forgotten Little Polo.

09:54.880 --> 09:56.970
He must have heard about him when he was young,

09:57.030 --> 09:58.670
and he's been stuck in his mind.

09:59.270 --> 09:59.850
Yes, yes.

09:59.870 --> 10:00.580
Yes, yes.

10:00.600 --> 10:01.440
Yes, yes.

10:02.670 --> 10:05.260
Isn't it amazing how this all turned out?

10:07.390 --> 10:09.430
It's confirmed for the Shao family, right?

10:09.460 --> 10:11.060
So is it for my family.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.670
What about the Xie and Xia families?

10:12.700 --> 10:14.220
We'll keep looking into it.

10:14.400 --> 10:16.530
The Xie family's ancestral home isn't local.

10:16.760 --> 10:18.020
We'll have to make a trip.

10:18.080 --> 10:20.170
The Xia family should be easier to look into.

10:20.200 --> 10:22.180
Then let's discuss it with Uncle Xia

10:22.210 --> 10:23.610
and make time to visit his hometown someday.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.680
No need.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.460
Have Yan make a call.

10:26.520 --> 10:28.620
If they have genealogical records,

10:28.650 --> 10:30.890
ask them to make a copy and send it over.

10:30.920 --> 10:32.800
As long as the name matches,

10:32.820 --> 10:33.910
it's confirmed.

10:33.930 --> 10:35.130
Mr. Shao, you're amazing.

10:35.420 --> 10:36.720
Impressive!

10:36.720 --> 10:37.780
Also,

10:37.810 --> 10:39.250
do you think we should

10:39.440 --> 10:41.470
tell Mr. Zhou this good news?

10:43.280 --> 10:44.350
We should.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.440
We must tell him.

10:46.470 --> 10:47.520
We must tell him.

10:49.620 --> 10:52.980
[Zhou Yiyan]

10:57.740 --> 10:59.770
During my afternoon nap,

10:59.790 --> 11:01.030
I had a dream.

11:01.960 --> 11:03.080
I dreamt that

11:03.790 --> 11:05.380
I was on a ship.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.850
It was at night,

11:07.870 --> 11:10.810
and people on the shore were shooting arrows at my ship.

11:11.420 --> 11:13.570
The ship caught fire.

11:13.640 --> 11:15.290
I woke up frightened.

11:16.720 --> 11:18.120
You dreamt of a ship?

11:20.930 --> 11:21.690
Dad.

11:22.860 --> 11:25.160
On that ship you dreamed of,

11:25.320 --> 11:26.840
was there someone named

11:28.030 --> 11:29.150
Little Polo?

11:29.360 --> 11:30.620
Little Polo?

11:33.410 --> 11:34.560
That sounds familiar.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.210
Little Polo?

11:38.080 --> 11:39.440
Little Polo

11:39.970 --> 11:41.440
was an Italian.

11:41.820 --> 11:43.240
He grew up

11:43.240 --> 11:44.600
loving Marco Polo's stories,

11:44.830 --> 11:46.830
so he was fascinated by

11:46.860 --> 11:49.500
our ancient country.

11:49.960 --> 11:50.960
After he grew up,

11:50.980 --> 11:52.980
he finally had the chance to come to China.

11:54.670 --> 11:57.030
He rented a ship in Wuxi

11:57.910 --> 12:00.720
and traveled north along our canal.

12:02.030 --> 12:03.030
On board with him were

12:03.030 --> 12:06.200
an interpreter named Xie Pingyao,

12:06.200 --> 12:09.200
a porter named Shao Changlai,

12:09.270 --> 12:12.120
and the ship owner called Xia.

12:12.780 --> 12:14.370
Xia had two apprentices,

12:14.400 --> 12:16.810
one of whom was named Zhou Yiyan.

12:18.270 --> 12:19.550
Zhou Yiyan?

12:20.720 --> 12:22.240
That also sounds familiar.

12:24.550 --> 12:26.080
I must have heard that name before.

12:27.790 --> 12:30.200
Little Polo, along with those people,

12:30.750 --> 12:33.320
traveled along the Grand Canal, observing it.

12:34.050 --> 12:35.720
At the beginning of the 20th century,

12:36.160 --> 12:37.680
what he saw was

12:38.390 --> 12:39.840
a China facing

12:39.870 --> 12:41.510
enormous changes.

12:43.270 --> 12:45.720
On that ship, Little Polo

12:45.790 --> 12:47.480
used a Parker pen

12:47.480 --> 12:50.480
to write his diary in a leather notebook.

12:51.160 --> 12:52.960
He used a Kodak camera

12:53.660 --> 12:56.650
to capture the customs along the canal.

12:57.550 --> 12:58.600
As for Xie Pingyao,

12:59.280 --> 13:02.850
he was reading books by Kang Youwei and Liang Qichao.

13:03.270 --> 13:06.480
He was pondering, with the influence of Western ideas,

13:06.550 --> 13:08.320
what path our ancient country

13:08.390 --> 13:10.030
should take.

13:10.600 --> 13:13.650
Xia's apprentice, Zhou Yiyan,

13:13.680 --> 13:16.870
began to show interest in foreign things.

13:16.940 --> 13:19.180
He was secretly learning Italian,

13:19.210 --> 13:21.390
believing that if he mastered a foreign language,

13:21.720 --> 13:24.390
his descendants might become interpreters too

13:24.720 --> 13:27.240
and live a worry-free life for generations.

13:28.630 --> 13:31.990
His eagerness to learn touched Little Polo,

13:33.060 --> 13:34.370
so Little Polo

13:34.490 --> 13:36.610
gave Zhou Yiyan a watch.

13:37.650 --> 13:38.890
And this watch

13:39.890 --> 13:42.300
has been kept by his descendants

13:42.330 --> 13:44.210
until today.

14:32.910 --> 14:33.910
Who'd have known?

14:33.950 --> 14:35.570
-It's shocking.
-Yeah.

14:36.030 --> 14:37.840
My family even had a connection to art.

14:37.840 --> 14:39.070
Yes.

14:39.330 --> 14:40.220
Oh, man.

14:40.250 --> 14:41.670
What's the occasion today?

14:41.700 --> 14:42.240
Uncle.

14:42.270 --> 14:42.920
Boss Xie, Boss Xie.

14:43.110 --> 14:44.270
Boss Xie, hurry.

14:44.290 --> 14:45.400
What's this gathering for?

14:45.830 --> 14:46.840
What's going on?

14:46.840 --> 14:47.840
We've been waiting for you.

14:47.840 --> 14:49.480
Look at these dishes.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.240
Let's have a drink first.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.120
Aren't they great?

14:51.200 --> 14:52.360
Let's have a drink first.

14:52.360 --> 14:53.120
Let me tell you

14:53.200 --> 14:54.000
some good news.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.080
Wonderful news!

14:55.080 --> 14:55.720
What's it?

14:55.720 --> 14:56.960
-You drink first.
-Drink first.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.200
We'll talk after you drink.

15:00.660 --> 15:01.420
Drink up.

15:02.840 --> 15:03.320
Great!

15:03.480 --> 15:03.960
Great!

15:04.000 --> 15:04.270
Here.

15:04.320 --> 15:04.750
Great.

15:05.550 --> 15:06.320
Xia, tell him.

15:06.320 --> 15:07.120
What?

15:07.200 --> 15:08.310
I've

15:08.440 --> 15:09.720
found my roots.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.660
My ancestor

15:11.830 --> 15:12.780
has been confirmed.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.230
Who?

15:16.360 --> 15:17.960
Remember that ship?

15:18.000 --> 15:19.670
They found a seafarer on the ship

15:19.720 --> 15:21.360
whose surname was also Xia.

15:21.700 --> 15:23.490
He was my ancestor.

15:24.630 --> 15:25.910
There are many people with the surname Xia.

15:25.960 --> 15:27.840
How do you know he was your ancestor?

15:29.200 --> 15:30.630
Look at him.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.110
I asked

15:32.110 --> 15:33.270
Yan

15:33.320 --> 15:34.840
to call my parents

15:34.840 --> 15:37.120
and have my mom look for our genealogical records and such.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.720
But we don't have such things.

15:39.750 --> 15:42.270
However, an old person in the village said

15:42.360 --> 15:43.840
that one of my ancestors

15:44.000 --> 15:46.120
indeed worked as a seafarer.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.550
He even worked for a foreigner

15:49.400 --> 15:50.470
and helped him out.

15:50.550 --> 15:51.240
That foreigner

15:51.320 --> 15:52.760
gave him

15:53.000 --> 15:55.560
an old Kodak camera.

15:55.630 --> 15:57.150
The thing Mr. Zhou called

15:57.200 --> 15:58.240
the "soul-capturing cannon."

15:58.550 --> 15:59.440
Yes.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.820
That's it.

16:00.960 --> 16:03.490
M-My family even has an old photo taken back then.

16:03.630 --> 16:04.910
They were afraid of

16:05.000 --> 16:06.150
persecution from the government,

16:06.200 --> 16:08.320
so they kept it hidden and never dared to show it.

16:09.750 --> 16:10.550
Where's the photo?

16:11.000 --> 16:12.390
H-Here.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.840
They've sent it to me. Look.

16:13.840 --> 16:14.480
Look.

16:15.200 --> 16:15.960
Take a look.

16:17.460 --> 16:18.260
See?

16:19.200 --> 16:20.720
This young man

16:20.750 --> 16:22.960
is Grandpa Zhou's ancestor.

16:23.270 --> 16:24.730
This porter on the side

16:24.840 --> 16:26.200
was called Shao Changlai.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.870
He was my ancestor.

16:27.930 --> 16:29.000
And the one

16:29.180 --> 16:30.860
dressed with a scholarly air

16:30.960 --> 16:31.750
and looking like an interpreter…

16:31.750 --> 16:32.110
This one.

16:32.110 --> 16:35.200
He was called Xie Pingyao.

16:36.000 --> 16:36.870
We are not sure

16:36.890 --> 16:38.120
whether this Xie Pingyao

16:38.120 --> 16:39.790
was your ancestor.

16:39.890 --> 16:42.000
So we need to make a trip to your hometown

16:42.000 --> 16:43.120
to investigate further.

16:43.320 --> 16:45.080
Xie Pingyao?

16:45.960 --> 16:49.210
Our ancestors were all on the same ship?

16:50.840 --> 16:52.600
This is too much of a coincidence, isn't it?

17:03.020 --> 17:04.250
Are you really going?

17:05.240 --> 17:06.240
The tickets are already booked.

17:06.310 --> 17:07.440
I have to go.

17:07.440 --> 17:08.720
Besides, Mr. Shao and the others

17:08.720 --> 17:10.490
all have good intentions.

17:11.000 --> 17:12.510
Why did you hang your shirt

17:12.510 --> 17:13.160
in my closet?

17:13.240 --> 17:14.550
It's so flashy.

17:16.359 --> 17:17.480
I think

17:17.550 --> 17:18.960
they've gone crazy.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.550
How can it be that

17:21.550 --> 17:23.700
those on that sunken ship

17:23.829 --> 17:25.960
were all our ancestors?

17:26.069 --> 17:27.750
This is too much of a coincidence, isn't it?

17:27.829 --> 17:29.440
As Mr. Zhou said,

17:29.590 --> 17:31.350
this is fate.

17:32.310 --> 17:33.960
If the guy called Xie Pingyao

17:34.000 --> 17:35.280
on Little Polo's ship

17:35.310 --> 17:37.450
was really the Xie family's ancestor…

17:37.590 --> 17:39.010
You know what?

17:39.070 --> 17:40.070
From now on,

17:40.310 --> 17:41.720
everyone in this courtyard

17:41.720 --> 17:43.260
will be our family.

17:43.550 --> 17:44.950
They already are.

17:45.110 --> 17:46.000
It's different.

17:46.720 --> 17:48.240
Firstly, I'm going

17:48.830 --> 17:51.440
back to my hometown to trace my roots.

17:51.590 --> 17:53.310
Secondly, I want to relax a bit.

17:53.580 --> 17:55.020
Are you sure you won't come with me?

17:56.070 --> 17:57.960
Our son is suffering in Beijing.

17:58.000 --> 18:00.160
I'm not in the mood to relax with you.

18:01.110 --> 18:02.510
Can't you

18:02.550 --> 18:04.750
have a little faith in our son?

18:07.160 --> 18:08.270
People are criticizing him

18:08.390 --> 18:10.310
all over the internet.

18:10.310 --> 18:11.640
It's so upsetting.

18:12.880 --> 18:13.920
I sent him messages,

18:14.000 --> 18:16.000
and he just replied, "I'm fine."

18:17.110 --> 18:18.200
The more he says he's fine,

18:18.440 --> 18:19.880
the more worried I become.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.310
If he was not fine,

18:23.070 --> 18:24.240
he would have come back already.

18:24.830 --> 18:25.350
Look.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.550
Fenghua,

18:26.550 --> 18:27.830
Haikuo,

18:27.880 --> 18:28.920
and Xingchi

18:28.960 --> 18:29.830
have all come back.

18:29.830 --> 18:30.960
They didn't say it out loud,

18:30.960 --> 18:32.110
but it's obvious that

18:32.110 --> 18:34.440
they couldn't hold on in Beijing anymore.

18:35.240 --> 18:35.960
If that's the case,

18:35.960 --> 18:37.240
I hope our son fails

18:37.270 --> 18:38.400
and comes back soon.

18:38.830 --> 18:40.110
He won't come back.

18:42.790 --> 18:43.930
How do you know?

18:44.160 --> 18:46.200
Because he's my son.

18:47.400 --> 18:48.720
At his age,

18:48.750 --> 18:51.200
I had already bought my first ship

18:51.270 --> 18:52.750
and married

18:52.920 --> 18:54.160
you,

18:54.160 --> 18:56.350
an adorable woman

18:56.680 --> 18:58.400
who gave me a strong boy.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.160
Back then,

19:00.400 --> 19:02.160
I felt like a king.

19:02.510 --> 19:04.270
Nothing seemed like a problem to me.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.270
I never

19:06.790 --> 19:07.880
groveled to anyone

19:07.880 --> 19:08.680
or begged anyone.

19:09.880 --> 19:10.720
Just

19:10.750 --> 19:12.200
give our son some time,

19:12.480 --> 19:13.240
okay?

19:18.070 --> 19:18.880
And this.

19:19.390 --> 19:20.000
Take it with you.

19:20.000 --> 19:20.920
Why?

19:21.110 --> 19:22.000
For safety.

19:22.760 --> 19:23.400
Alright.

19:23.400 --> 19:24.290
It's fine.

19:26.610 --> 19:27.720
And this too.

19:28.450 --> 19:30.400
I'm not going to drive the truck. You…

19:30.400 --> 19:31.440
Better safe than sorry.

19:31.440 --> 19:32.150
Okay, fine.

19:32.150 --> 19:33.110
Alright, alright.

19:33.110 --> 19:33.680
And also...

19:33.680 --> 19:35.640
Take care of them on the road.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.510
They don't travel much.

19:38.830 --> 19:40.680
Keep an eye out for them.

19:47.300 --> 19:50.070
[Jixiang Passanger Transport Co., Ltd.]

19:57.680 --> 19:59.240
Alright, be patient.

19:59.270 --> 20:00.650
Don't be downhearted.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.200
This kind of investigation

20:02.220 --> 20:03.560
is just like this.

20:03.590 --> 20:04.540
It takes time.

20:04.590 --> 20:06.070
I think we might as well

20:06.070 --> 20:07.310
head back.

20:07.350 --> 20:09.350
We've been totally clueless,

20:09.370 --> 20:10.610
running here and there.

20:10.640 --> 20:11.990
What can we possibly find?

20:12.390 --> 20:13.240
Now that we're already here,

20:13.270 --> 20:14.350
before we find something,

20:14.440 --> 20:15.730
we can't go back.

20:15.790 --> 20:17.640
If we prove that Xie Pingyao

20:17.680 --> 20:19.070
was your ancestor,

20:19.140 --> 20:20.160
it means

20:20.200 --> 20:22.240
everyone in our courtyard is family.

20:22.310 --> 20:24.270
What are the odds?

20:24.440 --> 20:26.790
Looking back several generations in my family,

20:26.830 --> 20:28.310
t-there wasn't a single scholar among us.

20:28.310 --> 20:30.460
And Xie Pingyao was an interpreter.

20:30.480 --> 20:32.830
I think we just happen to share the same surname.

20:32.830 --> 20:33.680
It's impossible.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.680
So we...

20:34.680 --> 20:35.360
Uncle Shao.

20:35.390 --> 20:36.400
We found something.

20:36.440 --> 20:37.200
What is it?

20:37.630 --> 20:38.640
My dad and I

20:38.680 --> 20:39.790
passed by an ancestral hall just now.

20:39.830 --> 20:41.160
We decided to go in and take a look.

20:41.200 --> 20:42.250
When they heard

20:42.280 --> 20:43.750
that we study history,

20:43.790 --> 20:45.400
they showed us a notebook.

20:45.440 --> 20:46.200
I took a look.

20:46.480 --> 20:47.480
The notes are in Italian.

20:48.820 --> 20:49.820
Boss Xie.

20:49.850 --> 20:50.610
Shao.

20:51.070 --> 20:52.110
Here's the thing.

20:52.200 --> 20:53.790
This gentleman's ancestor

20:53.830 --> 20:55.240
knew Xie Pingyao,

20:55.270 --> 20:56.710
and they were close friends.

20:56.830 --> 20:57.830
This is that notebook.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.000
Thank you.

21:04.590 --> 21:06.400
So this is Italian?

21:06.440 --> 21:07.700
Yes.

21:09.590 --> 21:11.070
I can't understand it.

21:14.720 --> 21:17.480
To my friend Shaoming.

21:18.030 --> 21:19.070
Wang Shaoming,

21:19.070 --> 21:20.640
my ancestor.

21:20.670 --> 21:21.890
Your ancestor?

21:22.900 --> 21:24.160
To my friend Shaoming.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.110
Study it often

21:25.110 --> 21:26.240
and recite it diligently.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.000
You'll then

21:27.270 --> 21:29.350
understand Italian.

21:29.440 --> 21:31.010
From Xie Pingyao.

21:31.650 --> 21:33.360
This can't prove anything though.

21:33.680 --> 21:35.140
There's also a letter here.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.200
Take a look.

21:36.650 --> 21:37.430
Let me.

21:41.310 --> 21:43.070
This notebook was given to me by my close friend Pingyao

21:43.070 --> 21:45.070
before he and his son Lingzhi

21:45.070 --> 21:47.270
left for Hangzhou.

21:47.310 --> 21:49.440
Pingyao once taught me Italian,

21:49.480 --> 21:51.790
but unfortunately, my talent is limited,

21:51.880 --> 21:52.440
and I can't…

21:52.590 --> 21:54.060
Hold on. What?

21:54.310 --> 21:56.820
His son Lingzhi?

21:56.850 --> 21:58.030
His son Lingzhi.

21:58.030 --> 21:59.200
Xie Lingzhi?

21:59.310 --> 22:00.300
To Hangzhou.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.990
That's my grandfather's elder brother!

22:07.270 --> 22:08.830
You eat too.

22:09.640 --> 22:10.640
I will.

22:15.750 --> 22:17.960
Have you decided what major you want to study?

22:23.470 --> 22:24.980
The teacher says

22:25.510 --> 22:26.550
you're good at science.

22:28.750 --> 22:29.750
I'm happy about that,

22:31.030 --> 22:32.510
but I also hope

22:32.790 --> 22:34.240
that you won't neglect other subjects.

22:37.200 --> 22:39.720
How are the other children doing at school?

22:40.680 --> 22:41.880
Xingchi is good.

22:43.030 --> 22:44.680
Wanghe and Fenghua are average.

22:46.030 --> 22:47.160
How about Siyi?

22:50.750 --> 22:52.270
She's at

22:51.400 --> 22:53.250
♫When the moon shines in the sky♫

22:52.780 --> 22:53.530
No. 1 High School.

22:53.800 --> 22:55.680
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

22:54.440 --> 22:55.510
She wants to apply for a normal college.

22:55.950 --> 22:57.630
Normal colleges are good.

22:56.220 --> 22:59.840
♫Who is still by your side?♫

22:58.880 --> 23:00.440
She'll become a teacher in the future.

23:01.030 --> 23:02.680
It's a stable job.

23:01.100 --> 23:04.420
♫As time passes♫

23:04.410 --> 23:06.930
Granny Ma will have less to worry about.

23:05.550 --> 23:08.790
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

23:08.030 --> 23:10.310
I was telling Granny Ma yesterday

23:10.780 --> 23:12.260
that at our age,

23:12.290 --> 23:14.540
♫When youthful company fades♫

23:13.030 --> 23:15.380
as long as we have enough to live on, it's enough.

23:15.110 --> 23:16.950
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

23:17.470 --> 23:18.820
Don't work too hard.

23:17.490 --> 23:21.080
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

23:19.510 --> 23:20.510
Look at her,

23:20.830 --> 23:21.680
getting up early

23:21.720 --> 23:24.960
and working late every day to earn money.

23:22.210 --> 23:25.760
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

23:25.380 --> 23:27.620
If she falls ill,

23:26.500 --> 23:30.710
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

23:29.030 --> 23:30.550
it'll not be worth it.

23:32.430 --> 23:34.250
We'll help her pay for

23:35.090 --> 23:38.260
♫Life is long♫

23:35.480 --> 23:37.200
Siyi's education, won't we?

23:37.900 --> 23:38.780
Grandpa.

23:40.210 --> 23:43.070
♫No need to dwell♫

23:40.850 --> 23:41.850
Don't worry.

23:44.030 --> 23:45.540
We…

23:44.580 --> 23:47.860
♫Like moonlight♫

23:46.090 --> 23:48.170
will definitely take good care of Siyi.

23:49.180 --> 23:52.540
♫Don't forget♫

23:49.510 --> 23:51.260
We won't let her suffer any grievances.

23:51.710 --> 23:53.180
And Fenghua.

23:53.480 --> 23:55.790
Although she seems carefree,

23:54.110 --> 23:57.470
♫Life is long♫

23:56.990 --> 23:58.110
in fact,

23:58.720 --> 24:01.960
♫No need to dwell♫

23:59.290 --> 24:00.570
deep down,

24:01.030 --> 24:02.480
she's more fragile than anyone.

24:03.080 --> 24:06.520
♫Like moonlight♫

24:04.880 --> 24:06.920
Her grandma favors boys over girls.

24:07.590 --> 24:09.000
Since she was little,

24:07.820 --> 24:12.570
♫The old times♫

24:09.220 --> 24:10.780
her grandma has never been nice to her.

24:13.270 --> 24:15.200
Fenghua doesn't say it out loud,

24:15.720 --> 24:17.510
but it hurts her inside.

24:19.800 --> 24:22.210
She doesn't want to upset her parents,

24:22.770 --> 24:25.020
so she just keeps it bottled inside

24:26.540 --> 24:29.540
and puts on a happy face.

24:31.470 --> 24:33.130
Girls like her

24:32.400 --> 24:34.300
♫When the moon shines in the sky♫

24:33.150 --> 24:34.180
will suffer a lot.

24:34.830 --> 24:36.740
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

24:35.980 --> 24:37.610
Their feelings are always ignored.

24:37.350 --> 24:40.990
♫Who is still by your side?♫

24:40.270 --> 24:42.160
Everyone thinks Fenghua is strong

24:42.180 --> 24:43.750
and doesn't get hurt easily,

24:42.190 --> 24:45.780
♫As time passes♫

24:46.030 --> 24:47.720
so they're all very mean to her.

24:46.560 --> 24:49.890
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

24:53.450 --> 24:55.510
♫When youthful company fades♫

24:56.040 --> 24:58.070
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

24:58.650 --> 25:02.240
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

25:03.160 --> 25:06.710
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

25:07.570 --> 25:12.130
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

25:08.790 --> 25:09.680
When we were kids,

25:11.430 --> 25:13.100
every time we played hide-and-seek,

25:14.420 --> 25:16.510
you were always the first one to be found.

25:16.190 --> 25:19.550
♫Life is long♫

25:20.110 --> 25:21.640
What made you

25:21.160 --> 25:24.320
♫No need to dwell♫

25:23.650 --> 25:24.870
think that…

25:25.770 --> 25:29.190
♫Like moonlight♫

25:27.310 --> 25:28.660
as long as you hid,

25:30.330 --> 25:32.020
you wouldn't be found?

25:30.450 --> 25:33.720
♫Don't forget♫

25:33.530 --> 25:34.630
Now in Jiangsu, Zhejiang, and Shanghai,

25:34.650 --> 25:36.330
we need a regional director.

25:35.070 --> 25:38.460
♫Life is long♫

25:38.000 --> 25:38.760
Hurry up.

25:38.830 --> 25:40.160
Go back and pack up.

25:39.850 --> 25:43.260
♫No need to dwell♫

25:40.200 --> 25:41.750
Go make your mark there.

25:44.460 --> 25:47.750
♫Like moonlight♫

25:46.030 --> 25:47.070
I want to take some time off.

25:48.010 --> 25:49.080
I have an urgent domestic matter.

25:49.040 --> 25:53.990
♫The old times♫

25:53.440 --> 25:54.270
How long do you need?

25:55.110 --> 25:56.030
I don't know.

26:00.880 --> 26:02.110
Not now.

26:02.880 --> 26:04.480
Our company is about to go public.

26:04.510 --> 26:05.350
You can't

26:05.440 --> 26:06.720
be distracted for now.

26:07.030 --> 26:08.550
Otherwise, even if I keep the position for you,

26:08.590 --> 26:09.680
you'll lose people's trust.

26:10.960 --> 26:12.030
If you leave now,

26:12.110 --> 26:13.880
all your previous efforts will be in vain.

26:14.270 --> 26:15.590
Bee wouldn't have made it this far

26:15.680 --> 26:16.590
without your contributions.

26:18.750 --> 26:21.240
Just enjoy the fruits of victory.

26:23.200 --> 26:24.270
I appreciate

26:25.310 --> 26:26.350
your kindness.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.400
But there's something more important at home.

26:29.880 --> 26:30.670
It's about a woman?

26:34.310 --> 26:35.350
If I lose my job,

26:36.160 --> 26:37.200
I can just find another one.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.830
But if I lose her,

26:41.030 --> 26:42.310
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

26:43.480 --> 26:45.070
Do you understand the cost of doing that?

26:45.630 --> 26:46.430
I do.

26:48.550 --> 26:49.550
I don't want

26:50.160 --> 26:51.640
to be called love-struck

26:52.070 --> 26:53.030
or a loser.

26:54.590 --> 26:55.900
I've hesitated.

26:56.830 --> 26:58.070
But when I thought about

26:58.590 --> 27:00.180
her hiding somewhere and crying,

27:01.400 --> 27:02.480
I just gave in.

27:03.040 --> 27:03.840
♫Fortunately♫

27:04.160 --> 27:06.100
♫You once gave me a warm hug♫

27:06.000 --> 27:07.550
I used to bully her a lot when we were kids.

27:06.580 --> 27:07.560
♫Unfortunately♫

27:07.970 --> 27:09.730
♫I can't have you, yet I still crave you♫

27:09.180 --> 27:10.530
It's time to make it up to her.

27:10.380 --> 27:11.300
♫How can I decide♫

27:11.630 --> 27:14.090
♫Which is messier, the beginning or the end?♫

27:14.660 --> 27:16.870
♫Both are unforgettable♫

27:14.920 --> 27:16.240
Let me tell you something.

27:17.390 --> 27:19.090
♫Why does your kindness vanish♫

27:19.380 --> 27:20.600
You can't hide from me.

27:19.420 --> 27:21.190
♫The moment I let go?♫

27:21.570 --> 27:22.990
♫How could you leave me so heartbroken♫

27:23.100 --> 27:24.310
Nor can you run away from me.

27:23.350 --> 27:25.650
♫That even my tears feel like they're burning?♫

27:25.830 --> 27:29.040
♫Maybe it's a relief that we're not meant for each other♫

27:29.450 --> 27:31.670
♫No need to suffer too long♫

27:32.060 --> 27:33.710
♫Why can you forget my kindness♫

27:32.480 --> 27:33.480
Don't be afraid.

27:34.040 --> 27:35.790
♫The moment you let go?♫

27:35.790 --> 27:37.020
I'm back.

27:36.160 --> 27:37.650
♫Making me look like a fool♫

27:37.920 --> 27:40.100
♫Even my longing feels like begging♫

27:40.520 --> 27:42.260
♫I'll let go eventually♫

27:42.840 --> 27:46.740
♫I'll say goodbye and disturb you no more♫

28:02.060 --> 28:02.930
♫Fortunately♫

28:03.270 --> 28:05.230
♫You once gave me a warm hug♫

28:05.540 --> 28:06.540
♫Unfortunately♫

28:06.920 --> 28:08.870
♫I can't have you, yet I still crave you♫

28:09.540 --> 28:10.420
♫How can I decide♫

28:10.770 --> 28:13.230
♫Which is messier, the beginning or the end?♫

28:13.860 --> 28:16.090
♫Both are unforgettable♫

28:16.690 --> 28:18.240
♫Why does your kindness vanish♫

28:18.530 --> 28:20.330
♫The moment I let go?♫

28:20.710 --> 28:22.190
♫How could you leave me so heartbroken♫

28:22.440 --> 28:24.450
♫That even my tears feel like they're burning?♫

28:24.810 --> 28:28.120
♫Maybe it's a relief that we're not meant for each other♫

28:28.680 --> 28:30.740
♫No need to suffer too long♫

28:28.790 --> 28:29.550
Young man.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.940
Your fried dough sticks.

28:31.080 --> 28:32.910
♫Why can you forget my kindness♫

28:31.180 --> 28:32.270
Thank you.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.330
Enjoy.

28:33.420 --> 28:35.090
♫The moment you let go?♫

28:35.350 --> 28:36.850
♫Making me look like a fool♫

28:37.110 --> 28:39.340
♫Even my longing feels like begging♫

28:39.920 --> 28:41.580
♫I'll let go eventually♫

28:41.690 --> 28:42.640
Don't eat fried food.

28:42.030 --> 28:45.410
♫I'll say goodbye and disturb you no more♫

28:42.720 --> 28:43.270
It's not healthy.

28:44.160 --> 28:44.880
Give it to me.

28:44.920 --> 28:46.400
Just a bite.

28:50.430 --> 28:51.500
Delicious.

29:00.920 --> 29:02.040
How long are you staying

29:02.270 --> 29:03.070
this time?

29:04.920 --> 29:06.070
It depends on you.

29:08.070 --> 29:08.880
Depends on me?

29:09.880 --> 29:10.680
How come?

29:12.000 --> 29:12.880
Don't play dumb.

29:14.060 --> 29:15.990
I'm not playing dumb.

29:16.640 --> 29:18.480
Just speak your mind. Make it clear.

29:28.270 --> 29:29.310
This was found

29:29.310 --> 29:30.830
under your mattress.

29:35.690 --> 29:36.810
It's not mine.

29:37.140 --> 29:38.420
You won't admit it, huh?

29:39.560 --> 29:40.840
Then I'll go talk to your mom.

29:42.530 --> 29:44.310
What do you want?

29:45.180 --> 29:46.370
If you're sick, get treatment.

29:46.390 --> 29:47.200
It can't be delayed.

29:47.270 --> 29:49.310
I am getting treatment. I've been taking medication.

29:49.310 --> 29:50.750
Conservative treatment isn't enough.

29:51.550 --> 29:52.990
You need to go back to Beijing with me.

29:53.640 --> 29:54.680
Get surgery if necessary.

29:54.720 --> 29:55.880
Have radiotherapy if needed.

29:57.070 --> 29:58.400
I'll be with you

29:58.420 --> 29:59.950
until you fully recover.

30:06.700 --> 30:08.120
What if I can't recover?

30:16.640 --> 30:17.400
Open it.

30:34.550 --> 30:35.750
They used to say

30:35.750 --> 30:36.910
I was hopelessly insensitive.

30:37.560 --> 30:38.430
I admit it.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.070
I want to change,

30:40.200 --> 30:42.010
but at my age,

30:42.520 --> 30:43.360
it's too late.

30:44.550 --> 30:46.480
I want to say something romantic,

30:46.830 --> 30:47.590
but I don't know how.

30:48.070 --> 30:48.880
So,

30:50.070 --> 30:51.400
I can only force you into marrying me.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.110
If you don't agree,

30:54.880 --> 30:56.530
I'll go to your parents

30:56.720 --> 30:58.870
and spend all I have on betrothal gifts.

30:58.890 --> 31:00.370
Your mom will definitely relent.

31:02.450 --> 31:04.000
Are you crazy?

31:04.370 --> 31:05.680
Let go of me.

31:08.660 --> 31:09.510
Fenghua.

31:11.780 --> 31:13.450
You've chosen conservative treatment

31:14.860 --> 31:16.410
because you don't want your parents to worry, right?

31:17.700 --> 31:19.080
It's not necessary.

31:20.370 --> 31:21.900
Relax.

31:22.490 --> 31:24.590
Get whatever treatment you need.

31:25.070 --> 31:26.000
If you're cured,

31:26.370 --> 31:27.400
everyone will be happy.

31:30.100 --> 31:32.300
If you die on the operating table…

31:37.310 --> 31:38.350
in the future,

31:40.880 --> 31:42.550
your parents will be my parents.

31:43.550 --> 31:45.270
I'll take care of them for life.

31:47.510 --> 31:48.750
I don't understand…

31:51.530 --> 31:53.120
love and romance.

31:53.310 --> 31:54.790
I've never been in a relationship before.

31:56.640 --> 31:58.270
But I'm sure of one thing:

31:59.720 --> 32:00.920
if your name

32:00.920 --> 32:03.480
can't be on my household registration booklet…

32:06.950 --> 32:09.050
I'll never have peace of mind in my life.

32:15.380 --> 32:17.110
You're just possessive.

32:17.300 --> 32:18.540
It's not love.

32:18.570 --> 32:20.000
I want you to be mine.

32:21.810 --> 32:22.760
Got a problem with that?

32:32.760 --> 32:33.800
From now on,

32:35.160 --> 32:36.270
I, Xie Wanghe,

32:36.880 --> 32:38.070
will be the son-in-law of the Xia family.

32:40.000 --> 32:42.080
I'll spend the rest of my life proving

32:44.170 --> 32:46.740
that you, Xia Fenghua, have impeccable taste

32:47.380 --> 32:48.940
in men.

33:02.450 --> 33:07.410
[Flying Bird Tea House]

33:08.070 --> 33:08.980
Sir.

33:09.070 --> 33:10.020
Are my vegetables packed?

33:10.290 --> 33:10.930
Yeah.

33:12.920 --> 33:14.000
-Okay.
-Thank you.

33:14.020 --> 33:14.670
Careful.

33:14.960 --> 33:16.150
Pick one yourself.

33:20.240 --> 33:20.750
Madam.

33:20.790 --> 33:21.840
Where's my tofu?

33:22.390 --> 33:23.240
It's ready.

33:23.240 --> 33:23.750
Thank you.

33:23.750 --> 33:24.480
You're welcome.

33:24.510 --> 33:25.070
It's still hot.

33:25.070 --> 33:25.750
Alright.

33:32.550 --> 33:33.240
Thank you.

33:33.270 --> 33:33.750
No problem.

33:33.750 --> 33:34.480
Thank you.

33:35.330 --> 33:36.170
Uncle.

33:37.000 --> 33:37.830
I heard

33:37.830 --> 33:39.380
you started learning to cook?

33:39.750 --> 33:40.400
Yes.

33:40.630 --> 33:41.550
Great.

33:41.550 --> 33:42.310
That's great.

33:42.310 --> 33:43.550
Maybe you have a talent for it.

33:43.550 --> 33:44.870
Do your best.

33:45.010 --> 33:45.900
Don't worry, Uncle.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.790
You should

33:47.830 --> 33:48.900
come to my place for a meal sometime.

33:50.930 --> 33:52.760
Alright, I'll get going.

33:53.720 --> 33:54.710
Take care.

33:54.830 --> 33:55.720
I'm off.

33:56.480 --> 33:57.250
Take care.

33:57.310 --> 33:58.160
A good cook

33:58.240 --> 33:59.630
is like a painter.

33:59.660 --> 34:02.680
When you start, you can plan and compose,

34:02.700 --> 34:05.250
but you can't be restricted by the details.

34:05.360 --> 34:06.130
Concerns like

34:06.980 --> 34:08.870
the brand of your brushes

34:08.900 --> 34:10.210
and ink

34:10.320 --> 34:10.920
are meaningless.

34:11.620 --> 34:15.050
You must first learn to use your heart, then your mind.

34:15.100 --> 34:16.380
Let me give you an example.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.250
When you like someone,

34:18.270 --> 34:19.610
you don't need to think about it.

34:19.630 --> 34:21.110
You just know

34:21.179 --> 34:22.940
whether you like her or not.

34:23.000 --> 34:25.040
Every cell in your body

34:25.070 --> 34:26.320
is reminding you.

34:27.030 --> 34:28.070
That's not scientific.

34:28.070 --> 34:29.590
Of course it's not scientific.

34:30.219 --> 34:33.080
Cooking itself is an art.

34:35.370 --> 34:37.100
This is important.

35:00.400 --> 35:01.000
What do you think?

35:03.260 --> 35:04.170
It's okay.

35:04.550 --> 35:05.360
Don't just say okay.

35:05.400 --> 35:07.090
Give me some specific feedback.

35:07.120 --> 35:08.000
Specific?

35:08.020 --> 35:08.580
Well…

35:11.360 --> 35:12.660
The soup

35:12.840 --> 35:14.370
seems to be missing something.

35:14.770 --> 35:16.170
M-Missing what?

35:20.110 --> 35:21.550
I can't put my finger on it.

35:21.550 --> 35:22.510
What do you think?

35:22.630 --> 35:24.160
W-What do you think?

35:24.230 --> 35:25.660
I really think it's fine.

35:25.920 --> 35:28.080
It's much better than the noodles in Beijing.

35:28.550 --> 35:29.550
It's pointless asking you.

35:29.550 --> 35:31.370
You even think instant noodles taste good.

35:38.310 --> 35:39.340
In the future,

35:39.900 --> 35:41.370
do you really plan to be a chef?

35:42.390 --> 35:43.650
Fenghua told me

35:44.290 --> 35:45.930
she hopes I can do

35:46.590 --> 35:47.960
something I truly love.

35:48.000 --> 35:49.190
After thinking it over,

35:49.670 --> 35:50.600
it seems

35:51.000 --> 35:52.630
I'm only happy when I'm cooking.

35:55.710 --> 35:56.590
Alright.

35:56.900 --> 35:58.260
Then go for it.

35:58.480 --> 35:59.650
When you're a good cook,

35:59.960 --> 36:00.920
I'll invest in you,

36:00.920 --> 36:02.300
and we'll open a big restaurant

36:02.320 --> 36:03.280
to cut in on his dad's business.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.840
I'll hold you to that.

36:05.050 --> 36:05.710
The apprentice is planning

36:05.710 --> 36:06.760
to steal his master's business?

36:06.840 --> 36:07.400
-No.
-Fine.

36:07.480 --> 36:08.440
I'll tell my dad to hold back some skills.

36:08.440 --> 36:09.280
No, no, no.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.670
That's not what I meant, Young Master.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.400
Look.

36:11.440 --> 36:12.480
You were talking nonsense.

36:12.480 --> 36:13.710
It has nothing to do with me.

36:13.800 --> 36:15.170
Well, it depends on your attitude.

36:15.710 --> 36:17.710
I'll tell my dad how many skills he should teach you.

36:18.150 --> 36:20.190
How do you think they're different from the noodles your dad makes?

36:20.360 --> 36:22.490
If I could answer that, I'd be teaching you myself.

36:25.950 --> 36:27.230
Let me tell you something serious.

36:31.110 --> 36:32.280
After I came back this time,

36:34.400 --> 36:35.760
I proposed to Fenghua.

36:38.630 --> 36:39.510
She said yes.

36:50.290 --> 36:51.130
Congratulations.

36:54.630 --> 36:55.630
It's

36:56.320 --> 36:57.320
good news,

36:59.360 --> 37:00.880
but my parents might not agree.

37:03.510 --> 37:04.440
Why?

37:14.710 --> 37:15.590
Fenghua…

37:19.710 --> 37:20.630
has a brain tumor.

37:22.320 --> 37:23.550
We don't know how long she has left.

38:08.780 --> 38:10.300
Hurry, come and watch!

38:10.320 --> 38:12.170
This TV series is so good.

38:16.210 --> 38:17.780
Look at them,

38:18.980 --> 38:21.250
falling in love so passionately in school.

38:21.360 --> 38:22.400
Look at you.

38:22.400 --> 38:23.070
You guys.

38:25.000 --> 38:26.670
It ends in tragedy.

38:26.710 --> 38:28.430
They won't end up together.

38:29.020 --> 38:30.300
How do you know?

38:30.590 --> 38:31.880
I've read the novel.

38:31.960 --> 38:33.260
It's heartbreaking.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.800
What's the point of watching a sad story?

38:35.840 --> 38:36.800
What a waste of time.

38:39.710 --> 38:40.920
I'll make up a story

38:40.960 --> 38:41.840
with a happy ending for you.

38:42.620 --> 38:43.190
Go on.

38:44.290 --> 38:45.460
For example,

38:45.840 --> 38:47.080
Fang Hui,

38:47.320 --> 38:48.360
after many twists and turns,

38:48.360 --> 38:50.580
still ended up with Chen Xun.

38:50.600 --> 38:51.740
They are planning to get married.

38:52.510 --> 38:54.330
But before the wedding,

38:54.800 --> 38:57.300
Fang Hui finds out she has cancer.

38:57.510 --> 38:58.810
So the two families…

38:58.840 --> 39:01.800
That's just the classic soap opera plot.

39:02.150 --> 39:03.710
The female lead

39:03.800 --> 39:04.840
either gets into a car accident

39:04.840 --> 39:05.800
or gets cancer.

39:05.840 --> 39:07.110
How can there be so many

39:07.110 --> 39:08.840
young girls getting cancer in this world?

39:08.860 --> 39:10.030
It's lame.

39:10.030 --> 39:11.190
That kind of TV series is pretentious.

39:11.320 --> 39:12.030
I don't want to watch it.

39:12.030 --> 39:13.360
It makes me uncomfortable.

39:13.400 --> 39:15.120
Let me finish.

39:16.000 --> 39:18.480
Fang Hui finds out she has cancer

39:19.150 --> 39:21.000
and is afraid Chen Xun's family will object.

39:21.480 --> 39:22.320
What do you think

39:22.480 --> 39:23.590
they should do?

39:23.960 --> 39:26.110
If she has cancer, she shouldn't be a burden to others.

39:26.150 --> 39:27.150
Just pack up her things

39:27.150 --> 39:29.000
and find a place far away to wait for death.

39:29.320 --> 39:30.550
At least she'll leave a good impression,

39:30.590 --> 39:31.320
right?

39:35.960 --> 39:37.760
What if I had cancer?

39:40.400 --> 39:41.320
What?

39:43.000 --> 39:44.280
I have a brain tumor.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.440
Wanghe wants to marry me,

39:47.320 --> 39:48.880
but he's afraid Ms. Liang will object.

39:49.860 --> 39:51.110
What should we do?

39:57.240 --> 39:58.140
-To our success!
-To our success!

39:58.160 --> 40:00.260
-To our success!
-To our success!

40:03.200 --> 40:04.720
Wow,

40:05.440 --> 40:08.180
my ancestor was an interpreter,

40:08.400 --> 40:09.390
an educated man.

40:09.710 --> 40:10.800
How come I

40:10.840 --> 40:12.230
ended up…

40:12.710 --> 40:14.150
I'm a disgrace to my family.

40:14.320 --> 40:15.620
Not at all.

40:15.710 --> 40:16.960
Boss Xie, you're a big shot

40:17.000 --> 40:18.670
on Flower Street, aren't you?

40:19.000 --> 40:20.770
-I'm nothing.
-After all this investigation,

40:20.920 --> 40:22.400
it turns out that Shao's ancestor

40:22.400 --> 40:23.510
was a porter,

40:23.510 --> 40:24.970
but Shao is well-educated.

40:25.000 --> 40:26.190
What a reversal of fortune!

40:26.230 --> 40:27.760
Yes.

40:27.800 --> 40:28.480
Mr. Shao,

40:28.480 --> 40:30.030
you should start

40:30.030 --> 40:31.230
compiling your family tree now

40:31.320 --> 40:32.190
and pass it down

40:32.230 --> 40:33.230
from generation to generation.

40:33.230 --> 40:34.400
-No, no, no.
-Bring honor to your family.

40:34.920 --> 40:36.760
Here is what I think.

40:36.800 --> 40:38.710
Compiling my family tree isn't very meaningful.

40:39.190 --> 40:40.440
I actually think

40:40.670 --> 40:42.790
we should write a play.

40:43.000 --> 40:44.110
We should include Little Polo

40:44.190 --> 40:46.150
and our ancestors in it.

40:46.170 --> 40:46.760
Think about it.

40:46.800 --> 40:47.440
This way,

40:47.710 --> 40:48.760
the story will not only be written down

40:49.000 --> 40:50.760
but also have sounds and visuals.

40:50.840 --> 40:51.590
Right?

40:51.630 --> 40:54.150
We can tour along the canal.

40:54.670 --> 40:55.400
This way,

40:55.440 --> 40:56.630
it will never be

40:56.670 --> 40:57.440
forgotten by the world.

40:57.480 --> 40:58.150
I think that's viable.

40:58.230 --> 40:59.840
Interesting idea.

40:59.880 --> 41:01.190
-Cheers to Mr. Shao.
-Great idea.

41:02.710 --> 41:04.000
Something happened.

41:08.000 --> 41:09.000
Wanghe

41:09.480 --> 41:11.000
wants to marry Fenghua.

41:11.880 --> 41:14.190
I-Isn't that a good thing?

41:17.150 --> 41:17.880
But

41:19.400 --> 41:20.880
something's happened to Fenghua.

41:22.180 --> 41:23.320
But I think we can add

41:23.320 --> 41:24.360
some Italian opera elements.

41:25.260 --> 41:26.150
Opera won't do.

41:26.150 --> 41:26.880
Opera will do.

41:26.880 --> 41:27.670
Just like they do…

41:27.670 --> 41:28.630
Or you could write a…

41:28.630 --> 41:29.510
On the ships in Venice.

41:29.510 --> 41:32.980
You can't have acquaintances perform in an opera, right?

41:33.030 --> 41:34.880
You can go perform in Italy.

41:35.750 --> 41:37.490
That would feel a bit weird.

41:37.710 --> 41:38.590
It's all about…

41:44.130 --> 41:45.210
I don't agree.

41:46.890 --> 41:48.190
-Your dad…
-Mom.

41:49.190 --> 41:50.710
won't agree either.

41:54.920 --> 41:56.870
When you have children, you'll understand.

42:01.470 --> 42:02.720
Marrying a girl

42:04.630 --> 42:06.860
who doesn't know how long she has left?

42:11.890 --> 42:13.330
No mother

42:15.000 --> 42:17.190
would agree to her son

42:17.220 --> 42:18.720
doing that.
